WEBVTT

00:00.670 --> 00:03.910
Tumeambiwa kwamba ndani ya miaka 40,

00:03.910 --> 00:08.170
umri wa Imran utakuwa mara 11 ya umri wake wa sasa.

00:08.170 --> 00:12.650
Na kisha wakauliza, je umri wake wa sasa ni miaka mingapi?

00:12.650 --> 00:17.420
Hivyo basi jaribu kufanya mwenyewe kwanza.

00:17.420 --> 00:21.210
Vizuri kwa kujaribu, sasa hebu tuone kama tunaweza kutengeneza mlinganyo.

00:21.210 --> 00:24.120
Kwanza tujiulize tunachokitafuta ni nini.

00:24.120 --> 00:28.590
Vizuri, tunachotafuta ni umri wa sasa wa Imran.

00:28.590 --> 00:29.970
Natumia x.

00:29.970 --> 00:31.515
Mara nyingi tunapenda kutumia x.

00:31.515 --> 00:33.380
Ambayo inaweza kuwa kitu chochote.

00:33.380 --> 00:36.460
Lakini tuchukulie x ni sawa na umri wa sasa wa Imran.

00:36.460 --> 00:39.410
Siyo miaka mingapi.

00:39.410 --> 00:43.800
Bali ni miaka mingapi aliyonayo sasa.

00:43.800 --> 00:48.560
Sasa, tunafahamu ndani ya miaka 40 tatakuwa na umri gani.

00:48.560 --> 00:51.970
Vizuri, umri wake wa sasa utakuwa jumlisha 40.

00:51.970 --> 00:54.230
Hivyo ngoja niandike.

00:54.230 --> 01:05.570
Ndani ya miaka 40 umri wa Imran utakuwa x jumlisha 40,

01:05.570 --> 01:08.534
jumlisha hii 40 hapa.

01:08.534 --> 01:10.450
Lakini wametupatia maelezo mengine.

01:10.450 --> 01:12.158
Maelezo haya pekee hayatoshi, kujua

01:12.158 --> 01:13.280
umri alionao sasa.

01:13.280 --> 01:18.120
Lakini wametuambia ndani ya 40,

01:18.120 --> 01:24.660
umri wa Imran utakuwa mara 11 ya umri wake wa sasa.

01:24.660 --> 01:27.100
Hivyo inamaana, huu mlinganyo hapa,

01:27.100 --> 01:31.770
x jumlisha 40, utakuwa 11 mara x.

01:31.770 --> 01:34.470
Ndani ya miaka 40, umri wake utakuwa mara 11

01:34.470 --> 01:35.980
ya umri wake wa sasa.

01:35.980 --> 01:38.990
Hivyo hii itakuwa mara 11.

01:38.990 --> 01:41.440
Unachukua x mara 11,

01:41.440 --> 01:44.770
utapata umri wake ndani ya miaka 40.

01:44.770 --> 01:48.100
Hivyo tuandike mlinganyo wake.

01:48.100 --> 01:55.640
Unachukua x, zidisha kwa 11, hivyo mara 11

01:55.640 --> 01:59.920
ya umri wake wa sasa ndiyo umri atakao kuwa

01:59.920 --> 02:01.460
nao ndani ya miaka 40.

02:07.150 --> 02:10.057
Tumeunda mlinganyo sahihi

02:10.057 --> 02:10.650
sasa.

02:10.650 --> 02:14.462
Hivyo tutafute thamani ya x.

02:14.462 --> 02:16.420
Tunaweka x zote upande wa kushoto.

02:16.420 --> 02:18.560
Tuna x zaidi hapa ukilinganisha na upande wa kushoto.

02:18.560 --> 02:21.335
Hivyo tunaepuka namba hasi, hebu tuziweke x hapa.

02:21.335 --> 02:23.710
Hivyo kama nahitaji kuondoa x upande wa kulia,

02:23.710 --> 02:24.852
nitatoa kwa x.

02:24.852 --> 02:26.810
Kwa kawaida, siwezi kufanya hivyo upande wa kulia tu.

02:26.810 --> 02:28.790
Vinginevyo, mlinganyo hauwezi kuwa sawa.

02:28.790 --> 02:30.860
Nifanya hivyo kwenye upande wa kushoto pia.

02:30.860 --> 02:34.580
Hivyo nabaki na--- kama nina 11

02:34.580 --> 02:37.190
kisha nikatoa 1, nitabakia na 10.

02:37.190 --> 02:44.950
Hivyo nabaki na 10 mara x ni sawa na-- vizuri, x

02:44.950 --> 02:46.090
toa x ni sawa na 0.

02:46.090 --> 02:47.360
Hivyo ndivyo ilivyo.

02:47.360 --> 02:49.099
Itakuwa sawa na 40.

02:49.099 --> 02:51.140
Unaweza kukokotoa kwa kichwa mpaka hapa,

02:51.140 --> 02:52.880
lakini hebu tutukokotoe kwa utaratibu.

02:52.880 --> 02:54.350
Hivyo kama tunahitaji kubaki na mtajo hapa,

02:54.350 --> 02:55.850
tutagawanya kwa 10,

02:55.850 --> 02:58.060
pande zote.

02:58.060 --> 03:02.080
Hivyo tunabaki na---

03:02.080 --> 03:09.290
Tunabaki na x ni sawa na umri wa miaka 4.

03:09.290 --> 03:12.840
x ni sawa na 4.

03:12.840 --> 03:16.850
Hivyo jibu la swali hili, Imran ana umri gani sasa?

03:16.850 --> 03:20.980
Ana umri wa miaka 4.

03:20.980 --> 03:22.640
Hebu tuthibitishe.

03:22.640 --> 03:27.250
Kama ana umri wa miaka 4 sasa, ndani ya miaka 40

03:27.250 --> 03:31.030
atakuwa na umri wa miaka 44.

03:31.030 --> 03:37.590
Umri wa miaka 44 ni mara 11 zaidi ya umri wa miaka 4.

03:37.590 --> 03:42.270
Hiki ni kigawo cha miaka 11.
